Package: devos-update
Version: 1.0.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DevOS <security@devos.local>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt, systemd, ca-certificates, gnupg, unattended-upgrades
Recommends: apt-listchanges, needrestart, x-terminal-emulator
Description: Safe update manager for DevOS
 Provides the devos-update command, a "DevOS Update" launcher in the app
 grid, a daily metadata refresh timer and secure defaults for unattended
 security upgrades.
